## Original Content
Aquilo que é hoje óbvio não o foi durante séculos: quando começámos a aprender a ler e escrever; como foram evoluindo os níveis de literacia; e quando teve início o esforço de alfabetização geral?

## Summary
The article explores the historical development of literacy in Portugal, addressing when people began learning to read and write. It examines the evolution of literacy levels and the start of general literacy efforts over centuries.

## Key Points
- Literacy was not widespread or considered obvious in Portugal for many centuries.
- The article investigates the timeline of when literacy started in Portugal.
- It traces the progression and changes in literacy levels over time.
- The initiation of efforts for general literacy is a central theme.


